      "title": "Cuckolding",
      "description": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>She explores. </em></strong><em>The thrill is in the </em><strong><em>power play.</em></strong></h2><hr /><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>This is you if:</strong></h2><p data-rep=\"true\" style=\"text-align:justify\">She is intimate with another man and your excitement comes from watching, knowing about it, or imagining it.</p><p data-rep=\"true\" style=\"text-align:justify\">Unlike hotwifing, the erotic charge isn't just her pleasure, it's your <strong>consensual submission,</strong> being <strong>\"replaced\"</strong> or placed in an <strong>inferior role</strong> within the fantasy, and the <strong>humiliation or loss of status</strong> that the dynamic creates.</p><p data-rep=\"true\" style=\"text-align:justify\">This is a kink-forward dynamic built on deep trust. It looks similar to hotwifing from the outside, but the fuel is different: it's the psychology, the <strong>power exchange,</strong> the <strong>surrender, </strong>and the <strong>consensual humiliation</strong>, <strong>all </strong>agreed, all negotiated, all in service of what turns you both on.</p><hr /><h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Your customized Get Started pathway:</strong></h2><p data-rep=\"true\" style=\"text-align:left\">Shows you how to explore this safely and consensually:</p><ul style=\"text-align:center\"><li><p data-rep=\"true\" style=\"text-align:left\">naming the dynamic together,</p></li><li><p data-rep=\"true\" style=\"text-align:left\">the right kink-forward online resources to find community and respectful partners,</p></li><li><p data-rep=\"true\" style=\"text-align:left\">understanding etiquette and aftercare, and</p></li><li><p data-rep=\"true\" style=\"text-align:left\">negotiating the power exchange with care.</p></li></ul>",
